<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Buttons must never be fully rounded pills. Primary uses the copper gradient. Secondary uses a 0.5px hairline outline. Ghost buttons are pure text with an offset underline.</p>
