<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">05. Typography</h2>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">The HNI architecture relies on a strict dual-font system. <strong>Marcellus</strong> provides editorial authority for display and headings. <strong>Manrope</strong> provides extreme technical legibility for data, kickers, and body text.</p>
