</section><section class="scroll-mt-16 mb-24 pb-16 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26]" id="06-grid">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">06. Grid &amp; Layout</h2>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Fibonacci grids and 1280px max-width container structures.</p>
<div>
<h3>Spatial &amp; Layout Variables</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Fibonacci Scale:</strong> Margins and paddings follow a Fibonacci rhythm (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8).</li>
<li><strong>Section Spacing:</strong> Desktop: <code>110px</code> | Mobile: <code>60px</code></li>
<li><strong>Container Max Width:</strong> <code>1280px</code> (Aligning to Rule of Thirds grid points)</li>
<li><strong>Blur Scale:</strong> Nav/Glassmorphism uses <code>16px</code> blur. Modals use <code>8px</code> blur.</li>
<li><strong>Z-Index:</strong> Modals (1000) &gt; Header (900) &gt; Dropdowns (800) &gt; Tooltips (700) &gt; Base Content (1)</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Section Theming (Alternating Backgrounds)</h3>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">To create visual pacing on long-scroll pages without relying on harsh drop shadows, we use <strong>Banded Sections</strong>. The page background must strictly alternate between these three environments to delineate different content blocks.</p>
<div>
<!-- Band 1: Titanium Frost -->
<div>
<div>Base Canvas</div>
<h4>Titanium Frost</h4>
<p>The default background for the majority of the page. Creates a soft, premium foundation.</p>
</div>
<!-- Band 2: Pure White -->
<div>
<div>Alternating Canvas</div>
<h4>Pure White</h4>
<p>Used for the very next section to create subtle, shadow-free separation from the Frost canvas above it.</p>
</div>
<!-- Band 3: Obsidian Breakout -->
<div>
<div>High-Impact Breakout</div>
<h4>Obsidian Black</h4>
<p>Used sparingly to break the flow. Reserved for footers, lead-generation forms, and massive value propositions.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-16 w-full text-left border-collapse font-sans mb-12">
<h3 class="font-sans text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#804526] mb-4 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26] pb-4">Grid Architecture</h3>
