</section><section class="scroll-mt-16 mb-24 pb-16 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26]" id="23-accessibility">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">23. Accessibility</h2>
<div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Focus &amp; Keyboard:</strong> All interactive elements must support standard <code>:focus-visible</code> (2px copper ring). Tab indexing must flow logically from top-left to bottom-right.</li>
<li><strong>ARIA Patterns:</strong> Accordions must toggle <code>aria-expanded</code>. Tabs require <code>aria-selected</code>. Modals mandate a focus-trap and must respond to the <code>Esc</code> key to close.</li>
<li><strong>Touch Equivalents:</strong> Hover-only tooltips or card-dimming effects must have a persistent or tap-equivalent display on mobile.</li>
<li><strong>Contrast Rules:</strong> Text must meet WCAG 7.0:1 AAA strictly. The CTA button passes AA (3.0:1).</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section><section class="scroll-mt-16 mb-24 pb-16 border-b-[0.5px] border-[#55555a26]" id="24-trust">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">24. Trust &amp; Compliance</h2>
<div>
<ul>
<li><strong>RERA &amp; Disclaimers:</strong> RERA registration numbers must be pinned to the primary hero section or the sticky global footer. "Artist's impression" labels must be embedded in the bottom-right of 3D renders.</li>
<li><strong>Stat Sourcing:</strong> Any numerical claim must have a source/date footnote linked directly below the component.</li>
<li><strong>DPDP Consent:</strong> All lead-capture forms must include a non-pre-checked consent block explicitly authorizing WhatsApp and Call contact under DPDP norms.</li>
<li><strong>Testimonial Rules:</strong> Testimonials must use a standard attribution format: [Initials/Name], [Profession/Sector], [Year], with verified consent.</li>
</ul>
</div>
